Noto Sans SC (Simplified Chinese)
Source: https://fonts.google.com/noto/specimen/Noto+Sans+SC
Version: v40 (subset, Regular weight only)

Copyright 2014-2024 Google LLC (https://fonts.google.com/)
Licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1.

The full license text is available at:
https://openfontlicense.org

This font is bundled ONLY for use as a fallback during PDF export unit
tests and local development on systems without a system CJK font installed
(e.g. CI runners). It is NOT included in the built application installers
(see tauri.conf.json bundle.resources). At runtime, the application
prefers the user's system CJK font (NotoSansCJK / Microsoft YaHei / SimSun /
macOS STHeiti etc.) for higher quality and proper font weights.
